{"id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-ambiguity.md","title":"文法歧义与语言的固有歧义","display":"df-cfg-ambiguity — 文法歧义与语言的固有歧义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","aliases":["73-df-cfg-ambiguity"],"display":"df-cfg-ambiguity — 文法歧义与语言的固有歧义","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]","[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4, print pp. 207–214; PDF pp. 229–236","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§4.3, p. 87; scan 95","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-ambiguity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-ambiguity — 文法歧义与语言的固有歧义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4, print pp. 207–214; PDF pp. 229–236"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.3, p. 87; scan 95"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。树、产出、语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t,u\\in\\{v:\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(v,S)\\}\\;[t\\ne u\\land\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)=w\\land\\operatorname{Yield}_G(u)=w]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t,u\\in\\{v:\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(v,S)\\}\\;[t\\ne u\\land\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)=w\\land\\operatorname{Yield}_G(u)=w]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w),\\qquad\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w),\\qquad\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InherentlyAmbiguous}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L(G)=L\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}ambiguity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InherentlyAmbiguous}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L(G)=L\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不同的无约束推导次序可能给同一棵树，因此不能仅凭两个一般推导就判定歧义。固有歧义量化所有生成该语言的文法，强于某一个文法有歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-tree-yield","status":"resolved","id":"4b4cb7350d4f0995","anchor":"re